"P68523420" "The Warriors are flexing their muscles again. This time one of their leaders, {BOSS_NAME},  has set up a contest in an old warehouse against one of the Freakshow, called the {BOSS_NAME2}, to prove who is superior. Bad guys beating on each other isn't that big a worry, but whichever side loses will probably take out their frustration on any innocent person who happens to be in the way. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to the warehouse, defeat {BOSS_NAME}, the {BOSS_NAME2}, and anyone with them.</A>We need to stop their games."
