// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1267548395" "Well done, you are as good as your reputation, {HeroName}. You have dealt with the Freakshow, besting their brute force and aggression. Now I want to see how you fare against one of my greatest foes, the backstabbing scum who call themselves the Family. You can find the lot of them in Independence Port."

