// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P664800017" "Great job dealing with those Warriors, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Warriors_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3460047056" "The Warriors have been terrorizing all of Talos Island, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can cut down their numbers in the Talos Island area</A>, and I think you can help."
// AcceptString :
"P620536229" "Defeat Warriors in Talos Island"
// SendOffString :
"P3100591425" "There have been reports of Warrior activity around New Troy, but I'm sure any neighborhood in the zone would welcome your help."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2217509637" "You'll need to defeat more Warriors around Talos Island to make a difference, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P450409964" "You have defeated enough Warriors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2331904166" "The Warriors have no compassion for anyone who hasn't proven themselves by their code. They'll terrorize any citizen just for kicks. I'm glad that you and other heroes like you are willing to stand up to them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_Warriors_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4082483344" "The Warriors have taken notice of you, {HeroName}. It seems that they're offering promotions to any Warrior soldier who can defeat you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you might want to hit the streets of Talos Island and show them that it's a bad idea to use you as an initiation trail</A>"
// SendOffString :
"P2136491679" "A number of ambitious Warriors have been making noise in the New Troy area, but you don't have to limit your efforts to that part of Talos Island. As long as you defeat them around the zone, the word should get out."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1211735178" "You still need to defeat more Warriors around Talos Island, {HeroName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1115188742" "It seems that the higher ranks in the Warriors have called off their test against you. Good work, {HeroName}."
